  "description": "YuNet face detection and SFace face recognition running on OpenVINO through OpenVinoSharp (Guojin Yan). Pure C# preprocessing, alignment and post-processing - no OpenCV dependency. Face detection: opencv_zoo face_detection_yunet_2023mar. Face recognition: opencv_zoo face_recognition_sface_2021dec (128-D features, cosine / L2 matching with official thresholds).",
